Package: mtbls2mztabm
Title: MetaboLights Studies as mzTab-M Files
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: person("Kozo", "Nishida", email = "knishida@riken.jp",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns the ISA-TAB files deposited with a MetaboLights study into
    mzTab-M 2.1 files. The study factors (sample groups), samples, runs and
    study metadata of a mass spectrometry assay are saved to a TOML file and
    its metabolite assignment file to a Parquet file. The metadata (MTD) and
    small molecule (SML) sections of the mzTab-M file are then built from
    these two files with the RmzTabM package and combined into the final
    file. The ISA-TAB files are retrieved through the MsBackendMetaboLights
    package. The main function takes a MetaboLights study identifier and
    performs all steps.
License: Artistic-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
